WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.114
It was a beautiful fall day.

2
00:00:07.115 --> 00:00:11.107
Tor looked at the blue sky.

3
00:00:11.108 --> 00:00:20.009
"It's a perfect day for flying!"

4
00:00:20.010 --> 00:00:23.646
"We can't fly," Sara said.

5
00:00:23.647 --> 00:00:28.348
"Let's have a party instead!"

6
00:00:28.349 --> 00:00:33.034
"Yes!" Rex and Sid cried.

7
00:00:33.035 --> 00:00:37.189
Tor sighed.

8
00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:44.059
"Rex and I will get flowers," Sara said.

9
00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:47.554
"Follow me, Tor," Sid said.

10
00:00:47.555 --> 00:00:50.178
"We'll get apples.

11
00:00:50.179 --> 00:00:57.062
I know where they are."

12
00:00:57.063 --> 00:01:02.164
Tor followed Sid up a trail.

13
00:01:02.165 --> 00:01:06.201
"It's a long walk," Sid said.

14
00:01:06.202 --> 00:01:10.178
"But apples are yummy!"

15
00:01:10.179 --> 00:01:14.632
"I could fly to the apples," Tor said.

16
00:01:14.633 --> 00:01:17.875
"No, thanks," Sid said.

17
00:01:17.876 --> 00:01:28.187
"It's a nice walk."

18
00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:36.721
Sid and Tor walked and walked.

19
00:01:36.722 --> 00:01:41.913
Finally Sid stopped.

20
00:01:41.914 --> 00:01:46.116
Tor saw a tree.

21
00:01:46.117 --> 00:01:48.792
Sid was frowning.

22
00:01:48.793 --> 00:01:52.436
"What's wrong, Sid?" Tor asked.

23
00:01:52.437 --> 00:01:56.347
"That's the apple tree," Sid said.

24
00:01:56.348 --> 00:02:01.411
"But there are no apples!"

